{"v":4,"catch":"拯救袋鼠寶寶，並消滅那些敵人的猴子！","desc":"“Kangaroo”是由SUNSOFT在1982年發行的動作遊戲。\n一隻袋鼠媽媽必須通過敵人的猴子猛擊，才能挽救它的小袋鼠。\n跳起來，用梯子上路。 猛擊敵人的猴子，然後到達小袋鼠等著你。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2020-07-16","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d15039ce622cb1b90a1139bf324cb43e681ec01e864ba08193ef962f8c8ccdae.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0986f2f857998b86ca5fce2cb0a4c3e4ca38ef93ae0ef0d714de5241ad2d85ad.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b37d362fdb14cf511483f08843c828666f933d1915eceb00e81bacf7f7e73702.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9aca4d5d8cbb64246ef173fac78911453da3497e9cf9ec5328231963449d8d3d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/799de0ee67ecb07adb2b604cf6acd499b85865972fcb6586f842643064873d50.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4d9259a531ce1998dfc53b8fb1c0fbedd5ad738870f5eb3e5a498ae33e34fbe0.jpg"],"titleId":"0100141011cf2000","dlc":[]}